snapshot-themes (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * License: Apache-2.0. debian/copyright is rewritten in DEP-5 and replaces
    the GPL-3+ placeholder.
    The Kali stanza (GPL-3+) now also covers the qt5ct and qt6ct color
    schemes, which come from Kali-Dark. xfce4-keyboard-shortcuts.xml is
    credited to libxfce4ui (LGPL-2+). The wallpaper and icons are brand
    assets (LicenseRef-Blackbird-Brand).
  * Maintainer: Blackbird Cyber, LLC at its GitHub address; Homepage,
    Vcs-Browser and Vcs-Git point at the repository.

