snapshot-themes (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Ship the SnapshOT-Dark GTK/xfwm4 theme, vendored from Kali's Kali-Red-Dark
    (GPL-3.0+) with trademark logo assets stripped and the accent recoloured to
    the SnapshOT brand red (#f1000e). See scripts/import-theme.sh and
    THEME-ORIGIN.md.
  * Add system-wide Xfce defaults under /etc/xdg: single top panel with a Whisker
    menu, xsettings (SnapshOT-Dark + Papirus-Dark + Cantarell/Fira Code), xfwm4,
    desktop icons, power-manager, screensaver, terminal, whisker defaults and
    keyboard shortcuts.
  * Add dark Qt defaults (qt5ct/qt6ct, Fusion + SnapshOT-Dark colour scheme).
  * Ship the Whisker button icon (snapshot-panel-menu) in the hicolor theme.
  * Rewrite the LightDM greeter config for the dark theme.
  * Depend on papirus-icon-theme, fonts-firacode and fonts-cantarell; drop the
    dead Recommends.
  * Diverts generalised to a FILES_TO_DIVERT list (panel, xsettings, keyboard
    shortcuts, whisker defaults, plus the existing wallpaper divert).
  * Drop the ineffective etc/skel xfce4-desktop.xml (xfdesktop keys backdrops by
    monitor name; the xfce-x.svg divert sets the wallpaper).

 -- Blackbird Cyber <snapshot@example.invalid>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

